---
kind: lore
id: south.hollowtownTown
title: Hollowtown — the town and its people
---

// Coming home: one line a day, by slot (the first visit is south.hollowtown).
<entry id="southHollowtownMorning" on="enterTown" target="town.hollowtown" category="bark" once="day" when="@isMorning">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Hollowtown in the morning: the fishing boats already out, the lab's windows already lit, and bread from somewhere.
</entry>

<entry id="southHollowtownDay" on="enterTown" target="town.hollowtown" category="bark" once="day" when="run.slot == 'day'">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Nothing happens in Hollowtown in the afternoon. It is one of the things Hollowtown is proud of.
</entry>

<entry id="southHollowtownNight" on="enterTown" target="town.hollowtown" category="bark" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Home. Every window is dark except yours, where someone has left a lamp on for you.
</entry>

// ── Granny Wren: the garden by the square; the parcel on the board ────────

<beat id="wrenParcel" on="talk" target="npc.hollowtownWren" title="The parcel" priority="20" when="quest.southParcel.state == 'active' && visited('south.pebbletonTown.parcel')">
  @hollowtownWren{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: My seeds! From Pebbleton! Hale said it would be a week and you did it in a day. Don't tell Hale.
  @hollowtownWren{code="0020"}: Now I can plant the Bellsprout bed before the equinox. Take this for your trouble.
  ::give{item="oranBerry" qty="5"}
</beat>

<entry id="southWrenMorning" on="talk" target="npc.hollowtownWren" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isMorning">
  @hollowtownWren{code="0010"}: Up early! Good. The Bulbroots come out to drink the dew, and they don't mind being watched if you're quiet.
</entry>

<entry id="southWrenNight" on="talk" target="npc.hollowtownWren" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isNight">
  @hollowtownWren{code="0010" emotion="worried"}: You're out late. Your mother's lamp is still on. Go and let her see you.
</entry>

<entry id="southWrenBadges" on="talk" target="npc.hollowtownWren" category="bark">
  <match>
    <when test="@badgeCount >= 2">
      @hollowtownWren{code="0010"}: Two badges, and all of Southshore talking about you. I told them I taught you to tie your shoes. I did, you know.
    </when>
    <when test="@badgeCount == 1">
      @hollowtownWren{code="0020"}: A badge from Petra! She used to buy radishes from me when she was your size. Hard as a rock even then.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @hollowtownWren{code="0030"}: Mind the tall grass, and mind your manners, and mind your monster. In that order.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>

// ── Teo: nine and three quarters ─────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="southTeoNight" on="talk" target="npc.hollowtownTeo" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isNight">
  @hollowtownTeo{code="0010"}: I'm not out late. I'm looking at the Duskbats. That's educational.
</entry>

<entry id="southTeoDex" on="talk" target="npc.hollowtownTeo" category="bark">
  <match>
    <when test="@dexCaught >= 10">
      @hollowtownTeo{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: {{@dexCaught}} kinds?! Show me the fossil ones! Show me the ones that bite! Show me all of them twice!
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @hollowtownTeo{code="0020"}: How many have you caught? {{@dexCaught}}? Kai says he's got twenty. Kai says a lot of things.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>

// ── Postman Hale ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="southHaleMorning" on="talk" target="npc.hollowtownHale" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isMorning">
  @hollowtownHale{code="0010"}: Morning post! Nothing for you. There's never anything for you. You don't know anyone who writes letters.
</entry>

<entry id="southHaleParcel" on="talk" target="npc.hollowtownHale" category="bark" priority="5" when="quest.southParcel.state == 'active'">
  @hollowtownHale{code="0010"}: You took the Wren parcel off the board? Bless you. My knees don't do the Hushwood any more. It's at the Pebbleton Mart, behind the counter.
</entry>

<entry id="southHale" on="talk" target="npc.hollowtownHale" category="bark">
  @hollowtownHale{code="0010"}: Letters for Tidewell go by boat, letters for Pebbleton go by me, and letters for Kai go straight back to the professor. Unopened. Every one.
</entry>
